{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Oh, <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>, welcome back."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">The night hasn't even fully lifted, yet </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> is up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Shoes on, bag in hand, she seems to be about to head out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm home. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Goto<STYLE ID="1">, you're up early. Is something going on?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Didn't I tell you? 
{PAUSE ""}
　There's a paper presentation contest in <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="みなかみし">Minakami City</STYLE> today."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, right. </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="1">, you've got it tough too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto's<STYLE ID="2"> face clouds over a little.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The reason is probably that I said, '</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="4" RUBY="・">, too</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, has it tough.'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Without realizing it, I'd said out loud that I have it tough.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>... you really don't look well. 
{PAUSE ""}
　Once things settle down for me, why don't you switch to a daytime job? 
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>, while you're gone, I'll stay with <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Heh, today they asked me if I'd be the manager of the second store! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　So I'm going to keep my job!"</STYLE><PG>
"Manager of the second store...? 
{PAUSE ""}
　But wouldn't that be a huge burden...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm needed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There are people who are happy because I'm there, so I want to work hard for their sake too."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>...! 
{PAUSE ""}
　Please... stop saying you'll work hard..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What do you mean, 'why'...! <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>, you push yourself too hard!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm happy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That I'm acknowledged, and needed."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"............!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Suddenly </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> looks heartbroken.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Is my trying to work hard really that...?</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
it's almost time for the first train, so I'll head out..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay... be careful."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm begging you... 
{PAUSE ""}
please take the mask off, soon..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Goto<STYLE ID="2"> leaves the house with those words.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Take the mask off...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Does she mean the story of the flesh-bound mask?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">When you wear a mask, you can't see what's in front of you clearly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That mask sticks to you because your heart is cursed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Am I... strange somehow...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Today, once I've showered, maybe I'll just go to sleep.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Usually at this hour I eat, let my stomach rest a bit, and then go to bed, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">My stomach doesn't feel very good.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe I'm tired after all.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\すずめ.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">―Through the gap in the drawn curtains, the spring sun shines in again today and begins to light the room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I guess I got about 3 hours of sleep.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I need to eat something soon and go to the hospital.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "2000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\夕焼け.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\五島家台所.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">There's no one in the house anymore.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In the kitchen, as always, my breakfast has been set out for me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Rice and miso soup, and three side dishes, plain yet with a touch of luxury.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I just don't have an appetite.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">My stomach's been off since yesterday.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">But going out without eating anything isn't good either...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I take milk out of the fridge, warm it to about body temperature in the microwave, and sip it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It doesn't taste very good.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto's<STYLE ID="2"> hot milk―have I gotten too used to it, or is it my bad stomach?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'll take some stomach medicine, then go see </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Since I'm going to the hospital anyway, maybe I could get myself examined too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―I'll ask what she thinks too, and take it from there.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\春花病室昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Good morning, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花入院3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's already 10, you know? Couldn't you sleep?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah... I got to thinking about some things..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Thinking about things?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Listen... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I really think you should rest a bit, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. You look paler than yesterday."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's because it's a little windy today. I won't open the window, so I'm fine now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"No, that's not what I mean... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">that's not it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">When </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has said that much, I turn my eyes outside the hospital room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "111.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院外風景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Warm sunlight, and cherry blossoms whirling down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I really do... hate cherry blossoms.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... why do you think I look pale?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... do you know why I'm tired?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Sorry... It's my fault..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, that's not true. That's not it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"............?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I hear I'm wearing a mask?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"A mask?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah... The flesh-bound mask."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Who told you that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... So yesterday, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="1"> didn't tell you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, tell me about it. Even with a body like this, I can still hear you out."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">―What </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> had told me yesterday about the flesh-bound mask, I passed on to </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And the news about my job, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The news about my job was something to be happy about, but did she pick up on something from the way I told it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> listened the whole time without changing her expression.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">People are tough creatures when things get hard. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">So sometimes they don't notice they're hurting, and by the time they do, it's too late."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Am I going to... just collapse one of these days...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Could be... Even to me, it looks bad enough to worry about. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Goto<STYLE ID="5"> lives with you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, right? If </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="5"> is worried, then something's probably really wrong..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But... what should I do...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"That's... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">that's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> words keep breaking off.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A problem like this isn't something that can be solved right away.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">In the first place, nothing has actually happened.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She's worried about what </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="・・・・・・">might</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> happen to me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... why do you always come and talk to me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Why... to me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Because I want you to get well, even a little sooner..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">seeing your face the way it is now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, I can't get well..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's because I haven't had breakfast. My stomach's just a little off."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, please, I'm begging you, rest even just a little. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">At least for 3 days or so. I'll be fine on my own for that long."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I don't want to be a burden on </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! Please, leave me alone for a little while!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\春花病室昼.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花入院3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What's that supposed to mean... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I've been doing it for you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, all this time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Am I a bother when I'm here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah... you are."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why...! Why would you say that...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Get away from me and try facing your own </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="めん">mask</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Look properly at what's reflected in those eyes! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Having </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> come here the way you are now IS a bother!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Even you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, saying that kind of thing... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's it... that's it, I don't care about you anymore, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE><PG>
